  "body": "Imagine pulling up the drive and feeling the day’s stress simply melt away. You are home, in your private oasis. \r\n\r\nStart your mornings with a quiet coffee on the wrap-around sunny deck. Inside, the heart of the home is the stunning new kitchen and generous lounge - just perfect for quiet Sunday relaxation. Everything you need for an effortless lifestyle is right here.\r\n\r\nWith four large bedrooms, there is room for the whole family to spread out and find their own corner of calm. The master bedroom upstairs is a true standout, featuring a walk-in robe so generous it could also be your sun-drenched private study.\r\n\r\nYou may prefer the bedroom downstairs as your master retreat - with en suite and exclusive access it would be ideal. Or it could be a great space for your lucky teenager. Or perhaps the ultimate home office?\r\n\r\nIn the mornings walk the little ones up the street to school - no car keys required. In the afternoon, stroll down to Madills Farm for a run-around after the school bell rings. On weekends pack a picnic and go to nearby Kohimarama Beach where the real fun begins.\r\n\r\nHurry - your new home is calling!\r\n\r\nPlease visit www.barfoot.co.nz/928993 and scroll down to download or view: Title; LIM (where available); Particulars and Conditions of Sale by Auction (where applicable); and other informative documents\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
